WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:02.168
Congressman, do you think the president

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:03.003
shooting this thing down

00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:04.371
was the right decision?

00:00:04.371 --> 00:00:06.740
What do you make of this object?

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:07.540
As little as we

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:09.242
I mean, it's not the right decision.

00:00:09.242 --> 00:00:11.144
It's it's it's a mystery.

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:12.012
I mean, obviously,

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:13.580
it doesn't appear to be a balloon

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:15.715
like we dealt with all of last week.

00:00:15.715 --> 00:00:18.718
Evidently, it hung around.

00:00:18.752 --> 00:00:20.553
I've heard that it's not maneuverable.

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:21.755
There's a lot of stuff

00:00:21.755 --> 00:00:22.622
out there in the air,

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:23.289
on the Internet,

00:00:23.289 --> 00:00:24.691
on Twitter describing it,

00:00:24.691 --> 00:00:25.191
which I don't know

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:26.426
if it's true or just rumor,

00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:28.528
but it's certainly to me,

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:30.296
looks like something that either

00:00:30.296 --> 00:00:31.898
China or Russia,

00:00:31.898 --> 00:00:32.665
you know, I guess it's

00:00:32.665 --> 00:00:33.333
quite possible

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:33.833
that there could be

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:34.901
some commercial entity

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:36.403
that was testing something.

00:00:36.403 --> 00:00:38.238
But given the proximity

00:00:38.238 --> 00:00:39.939
to military bases,

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:42.042
and stuff with our defense,

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:43.309
it's it's very interesting.

00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:45.011
And I think there's a lot we

00:00:45.011 --> 00:00:46.413
we may not even find out,

00:00:46.413 --> 00:00:47.580
but there's a lot to be learned.

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:48.581
Is there anything

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:48.782
I mean,

00:00:48.782 --> 00:00:50.150
in this area in particular

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:51.317
that would have been of

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:52.852
interest to adversaries?

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:54.854
Well, there's

00:00:54.854 --> 00:00:56.523
air defense, there's military

00:00:56.523 --> 00:00:58.191
bases, there's fighter bases.

00:00:58.191 --> 00:00:59.392
There's some energy intense

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:00.960
stuff up there.

00:01:01.361 --> 00:01:02.295
Alaska actually plays

00:01:02.295 --> 00:01:03.363
a very important role

00:01:03.363 --> 00:01:04.631
in national defense, particularly

00:01:04.631 --> 00:01:07.100
when you're looking at to its west.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:08.301
You look at Russia

00:01:08.301 --> 00:01:08.902
and you look at

00:01:08.902 --> 00:01:11.171
around the globe to China.

00:01:11.171 --> 00:01:11.671
So, yeah,

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:11.905
I mean,

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:13.773
it could be anything from that level.

00:01:13.773 --> 00:01:14.674
But I mean,

00:01:14.674 --> 00:01:15.308
it's really kind

00:01:15.308 --> 00:01:16.342
of an interesting mystery.

00:01:16.342 --> 00:01:17.744
And I think they made the absolute

00:01:17.744 --> 00:01:19.379
right decision to shoot it down

00:01:19.379 --> 00:01:21.147
I'm not sure if it was shot down

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:22.082
because of,

00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:23.950
you know, commercial airline traffic,

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:24.684
as they've said.

00:01:24.684 --> 00:01:25.385
I think that's probably

00:01:25.385 --> 00:01:26.186
the right thing to say.

00:01:26.186 --> 00:01:27.020
But look, it's

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:28.521
pretty sparsely populated out there.

00:01:28.521 --> 00:01:29.522
And you can always vector

00:01:29.522 --> 00:01:31.391
traffic around something.

00:01:31.391 --> 00:01:32.525
So I certainly think

00:01:32.525 --> 00:01:33.793
they saw it as a threat

00:01:33.793 --> 00:01:35.728
if it does turn out to be China

00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:37.764
or another adversary like Russia.

00:01:39.265 --> 00:01:40.233
What happens then?

00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:41.167
I mean,

00:01:41.501 --> 00:01:42.702
obviously, countries

00:01:42.702 --> 00:01:44.971
probe each other all the time,

00:01:44.971 --> 00:01:46.106
looking for,

00:01:46.106 --> 00:01:46.473
you know,

00:01:46.473 --> 00:01:48.475
trying to trying to spy on each other.

00:01:48.508 --> 00:01:51.511
Should there be other action?

00:01:51.611 --> 00:01:53.213
No, I don't think it should escalate.

00:01:53.213 --> 00:01:54.214
I mean, you know,

00:01:54.214 --> 00:01:54.948
I think it's

00:01:54.948 --> 00:01:57.183
it does end up being China or Russia.

00:01:57.217 --> 00:01:59.252
We obviously should be concerned.

00:01:59.552 --> 00:02:01.054
And I think we've made it clear

00:02:01.054 --> 00:02:02.255
the president has made it clear

00:02:02.255 --> 00:02:03.990
and DOD has made it clear

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:05.725
that we're not going to allow incursions

00:02:05.725 --> 00:02:06.593
into our airspace.

00:02:06.593 --> 00:02:07.360
And so,

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:07.594
you know,

00:02:07.594 --> 00:02:09.195
if China wants to put something

00:02:09.195 --> 00:02:10.997
up, a balloon in some cases

00:02:10.997 --> 00:02:12.332
or maybe possibly

00:02:12.332 --> 00:02:13.800
whatever this object was,

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:14.767
it's going to cost them that

00:02:14.767 --> 00:02:16.269
because we will defend our airspace.

00:02:16.269 --> 00:02:18.004
And I think that's the right call

00:02:18.004 --> 00:02:19.105
because that's the way

00:02:19.105 --> 00:02:19.973
you actually stop

00:02:19.973 --> 00:02:22.142
this kind of encroachment from happening,

00:02:22.142 --> 00:02:22.876
is you make it clear

00:02:22.876 --> 00:02:23.776
it will be a waste of money

00:02:23.776 --> 00:02:25.078
because we're going to take it down.

00:02:25.078 --> 00:02:25.745
Do you think some

00:02:25.745 --> 00:02:27.881
I mean, you were sort of indicating this

00:02:28.081 --> 00:02:29.282
you know, the argument is, well,

00:02:29.282 --> 00:02:30.717
it was said at commercial

00:02:30.717 --> 00:02:32.218
air traffic level.

00:02:32.218 --> 00:02:33.052
It does seem like

00:02:33.052 --> 00:02:34.220
some of the reaction to this

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:36.055
may have been just based on the criticism

00:02:36.055 --> 00:02:37.991
the Biden administration had received for

00:02:37.991 --> 00:02:40.160
for waiting on the Chinese spy balloon.

00:02:41.494 --> 00:02:42.495
It's certainly possible.

00:02:42.495 --> 00:02:44.264
But it's also you look at,

00:02:44.264 --> 00:02:44.664
you know,

00:02:44.664 --> 00:02:46.166
did they gather intelligence

00:02:46.166 --> 00:02:48.168
when the spy balloon came over?

00:02:48.168 --> 00:02:49.836
Evidently, we did.

00:02:49.836 --> 00:02:51.738
And I think from that point,

00:02:51.738 --> 00:02:52.539
so you can allow it

00:02:52.539 --> 00:02:53.606
to traverse the country

00:02:53.606 --> 00:02:55.008
once, get whatever intelligence

00:02:55.008 --> 00:02:55.842
you need to.

00:02:55.842 --> 00:02:56.843
But we can't allow

00:02:56.843 --> 00:02:58.011
something like that again.

00:02:58.011 --> 00:02:59.312
So as a response

00:02:59.312 --> 00:03:00.980
to political pressure, possibly,

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:02.882
I doubt the DOD

00:03:02.882 --> 00:03:04.517
would recommend shooting something down

00:03:04.517 --> 00:03:06.152
because of the politics of it.

00:03:06.152 --> 00:03:07.687
I would think that at this point,

00:03:07.687 --> 00:03:08.988
we're making it very clear

00:03:08.988 --> 00:03:10.857
that you basically got one chance

00:03:10.857 --> 00:03:12.692
to fly something over our country

00:03:12.692 --> 00:03:13.159
and after that,

00:03:13.159 --> 00:03:14.661
you're not going to make it in. Yeah.

00:03:14.661 --> 00:03:15.428
Congressman Kinzinger,

00:03:15.428 --> 00:03:16.129
appreciate your time.

00:03:16.129 --> 00:03:16.763
Thanks so much.

00:03:16.763 --> 00:03:17.664
Want to get perspective now

00:03:17.664 --> 00:03:18.031
for James

00:03:18.031 --> 00:03:18.665
Clapper, former

00:03:18.665 --> 00:03:19.832
director of national intelligence

00:03:19.832 --> 00:03:20.833
and currently a CNN

00:03:20.833 --> 00:03:21.868
national security analyst.

00:03:21.868 --> 00:03:22.969
Also, William Cohen,

00:03:22.969 --> 00:03:24.037
who served as defense secretary

00:03:24.037 --> 00:03:25.004
during the Clinton administration

00:03:25.004 --> 00:03:25.972
as Secretary Cohen.

00:03:25.972 --> 00:03:26.673
How much in your view

00:03:26.673 --> 00:03:28.007
was this about neutralizing

00:03:28.007 --> 00:03:29.108
a threat to civilian aircraft

00:03:29.108 --> 00:03:30.944
and how much about sending a message to

00:03:32.312 --> 00:03:33.980
the American population and

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:35.715
also other countries?

00:03:36.115 --> 00:03:37.383
I don't think the altitude

00:03:37.383 --> 00:03:39.519
was really the dispositive factor here.

00:03:40.253 --> 00:03:42.722
Let's assume that the object was flying

00:03:42.722 --> 00:03:46.292
at 50,000 feet or 60,000 feet.

00:03:46.993 --> 00:03:48.094
I think the answer would have I'm

00:03:48.094 --> 00:03:50.063
a little shot down anyway.

00:03:50.063 --> 00:03:52.532
So that may have been a factor involved,

00:03:52.932 --> 00:03:54.000
but I think that was not

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:55.134
the dominant reason.

00:03:55.134 --> 00:03:56.369
I think you're sending a message

00:03:56.369 --> 00:03:57.637
to whoever sent this up,

00:03:57.637 --> 00:03:59.539
whether it was China or Russia

00:03:59.539 --> 00:04:02.075
or some other country.

00:04:02.075 --> 00:04:04.410
If you invade in our airspace,

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:05.678
we're going to take it out.

00:04:05.678 --> 00:04:07.780
Now, there's a cost to it.

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:08.948
I'm sorry, Congressman.

00:04:08.948 --> 00:04:11.951
Hasn't you said there's a cost to them.

00:04:11.985 --> 00:04:13.052
There's a cost to us.

00:04:13.052 --> 00:04:14.087
Those Sidewinder

00:04:14.087 --> 00:04:17.857
missiles cost about 380 $400,000.

00:04:18.091 --> 00:04:20.860
So every time they put a cheap balloon up

00:04:21.127 --> 00:04:22.462
or some other object,

00:04:22.462 --> 00:04:23.529
we have to take it down.

00:04:23.529 --> 00:04:25.431
It's not without expense to us as well.

00:04:25.431 --> 00:04:25.999
Now, I doubt

00:04:25.999 --> 00:04:27.634
if that's the cost formula

00:04:27.634 --> 00:04:29.269
going into effect right now.

00:04:29.269 --> 00:04:30.103
I think

00:04:30.169 --> 00:04:32.038
I think it was right to take it down,

00:04:32.038 --> 00:04:33.773
and I think it was right to wait on the

00:04:33.773 --> 00:04:35.308
the first Chinese balloon

00:04:35.308 --> 00:04:36.709
that went to dredge clapper.

00:04:36.709 --> 00:04:37.243
I mean, the U.S.

00:04:37.243 --> 00:04:38.811
released very few details about

00:04:38.811 --> 00:04:39.812
the object shot down.

00:04:41.014 --> 00:04:42.715
Would they have photographed it

00:04:42.715 --> 00:04:44.050
before shooting it down?

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:44.384
I mean, would

00:04:44.384 --> 00:04:46.019
they have actually had eyes on it?

00:04:46.019 --> 00:04:47.020
Do you think

00:04:48.588 --> 00:04:51.090
Well, I don't know.

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:54.460
Hopefully they did or had some indication

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:56.829
of the nature of its payload.

00:04:56.829 --> 00:04:58.531
It would appear, though, that

00:04:58.531 --> 00:05:02.035
just from its its size, that

00:05:02.635 --> 00:05:05.605
it didn't represent the technology

00:05:05.605 --> 00:05:06.472
that apparently

00:05:06.472 --> 00:05:09.275
was represented on the Chinese balloon.

00:05:10.143 --> 00:05:12.612
So I do think, if I may,

00:05:12.845 --> 00:05:14.447
just a broader comment,

00:05:14.447 --> 00:05:16.683
I do think it would be very useful

00:05:16.683 --> 00:05:19.218
as this situation evolves

00:05:19.252 --> 00:05:22.655
if administration could devise a protocol

00:05:23.222 --> 00:05:25.425
that could be explained to the Congress

00:05:25.425 --> 00:05:26.726
and to the public

00:05:26.726 --> 00:05:29.462
as what the ground rules are on

00:05:30.163 --> 00:05:32.165
when and where and under

00:05:32.165 --> 00:05:32.832
what conditions

00:05:32.832 --> 00:05:34.801
would shoot one down or what

00:05:34.801 --> 00:05:36.602
all those conditions

00:05:36.602 --> 00:05:38.371
that we would want to observe it

00:05:38.371 --> 00:05:39.572
for intelligence purposes.

00:05:39.572 --> 00:05:40.840
Now, speaking purely

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:42.041
as an intelligence guy,

00:05:43.042 --> 00:05:44.744
I was

00:05:44.744 --> 00:05:46.379
amused a bit by

00:05:46.379 --> 00:05:48.047
those who were complaining about it.

00:05:48.047 --> 00:05:49.816
This the Chinese balloon

00:05:49.816 --> 00:05:51.818
being an intelligence failure.

00:05:51.818 --> 00:05:53.419
But you're also complaining

00:05:53.419 --> 00:05:54.721
because we took the time

00:05:54.721 --> 00:05:56.289
to learn something about it.

00:05:56.289 --> 00:05:58.057
And it's not like we can fly over

00:05:58.057 --> 00:06:00.026
China and observe one of their balloons.

00:06:00.026 --> 00:06:01.394
So this was an opportunity

00:06:01.394 --> 00:06:02.395
to gain intelligence.

00:06:02.395 --> 00:06:03.963
And so I think that

00:06:03.963 --> 00:06:05.365
that may have been a valid argument

00:06:05.365 --> 00:06:06.499
all to say.

00:06:06.499 --> 00:06:07.800
I think it would be a good thing

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:09.769
if we had a protocol.

00:06:09.769 --> 00:06:11.671
It could be explained both to the public

00:06:11.671 --> 00:06:13.072
and especially the Congress

00:06:13.072 --> 00:06:15.007
about the suggestion of ground rules.

00:06:15.007 --> 00:06:16.509
So, General Clapper,

00:06:16.509 --> 00:06:18.077
one can gather intel

00:06:18.077 --> 00:06:19.278
in the balloon incident.

00:06:19.278 --> 00:06:22.115
You can gather intelligence

00:06:22.115 --> 00:06:24.283
just by following the balloon,

00:06:24.283 --> 00:06:25.918
watching it, reading signals

00:06:25.918 --> 00:06:26.753
off it or something.

00:06:28.254 --> 00:06:29.255
Well,

00:06:29.922 --> 00:06:30.523
yes.

00:06:30.523 --> 00:06:31.691
And if you can observe it

00:06:31.691 --> 00:06:32.825
up close and personal,

00:06:32.825 --> 00:06:35.695
you can learn a lot about, for example,

00:06:35.962 --> 00:06:37.663
at antenna design up

00:06:37.663 --> 00:06:37.930
there,

00:06:37.930 --> 00:06:40.066
you can do forensics on the antennas

00:06:40.433 --> 00:06:42.034
that figure out,

00:06:42.201 --> 00:06:42.935
you know, that

00:06:42.935 --> 00:06:44.036
the nature of where

00:06:44.036 --> 00:06:45.037
there might have been

00:06:45.037 --> 00:06:47.173
a transmitter or a receiver

00:06:47.173 --> 00:06:49.509
which is very useful to know

00:06:49.509 --> 00:06:52.145
if you're going to continue

00:06:52.145 --> 00:06:53.646
to glean intelligence on what

00:06:53.646 --> 00:06:56.048
just what one of these things is doing.

00:06:56.048 --> 00:06:58.418
So there are and the other

00:06:58.551 --> 00:06:58.885
part of

00:06:58.885 --> 00:07:01.187
this is there are ways to collect

00:07:01.187 --> 00:07:02.422
intelligence on the balloon

00:07:02.422 --> 00:07:04.690
that is not directly connected

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:06.993
physically with the balloon itself.

00:07:06.993 --> 00:07:09.362
So if we have some insight into its

00:07:09.662 --> 00:07:11.164
launch facilities

00:07:11.164 --> 00:07:12.064
and the protocols

00:07:12.064 --> 00:07:13.032
the Chinese use

00:07:13.032 --> 00:07:14.066
when they launch, that's

00:07:14.066 --> 00:07:16.235
all valuable stuff.

00:07:16.235 --> 00:07:16.969
And particularly

00:07:16.969 --> 00:07:18.104
if you can connect that

00:07:18.104 --> 00:07:19.939
with the actual operation of the balloon

00:07:19.939 --> 00:07:21.007
as it's flying.

00:07:21.007 --> 00:07:21.741
Secretary Cohen,

00:07:21.741 --> 00:07:22.809
do you do you agree with that,

00:07:22.809 --> 00:07:23.876
with the Director Clapper,

00:07:23.876 --> 00:07:24.510
that there should be

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:27.313
some sort of publicly announced protocols

00:07:27.313 --> 00:07:29.115
or at least explained protocols?

00:07:30.082 --> 00:07:30.683
I think

00:07:30.683 --> 00:07:31.284
General Clapper

00:07:31.284 --> 00:07:32.251
is absolutely correct

00:07:32.251 --> 00:07:32.752
in terms

00:07:32.752 --> 00:07:35.488
of making sure that Congress is on board.

00:07:35.855 --> 00:07:37.557
One of the things that's taking place is

00:07:37.557 --> 00:07:39.392
everybody is trying to be a quick draw.

00:07:39.392 --> 00:07:40.460
McCraw come out and say,

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:42.328
who's got the fastest gun in the West?

00:07:42.328 --> 00:07:43.129
And I think what we have,

00:07:43.129 --> 00:07:43.896
what we saw

00:07:43.896 --> 00:07:45.131
is this administration

00:07:45.131 --> 00:07:47.133
acting and our military acting

00:07:47.133 --> 00:07:48.601
with restraint

00:07:48.601 --> 00:07:50.102
to first understand

00:07:50.102 --> 00:07:51.437
what the object was

00:07:51.437 --> 00:07:52.705
in the Chinese balloon.

00:07:52.705 --> 00:07:54.173
See, if we get intelligence

00:07:54.173 --> 00:07:55.842
that General Clapper was saying

00:07:55.842 --> 00:07:56.642
but there was something else

00:07:56.642 --> 00:07:57.610
that came out of that.

00:07:57.610 --> 00:07:59.378
We found out that we knew

00:07:59.378 --> 00:08:00.480
several years ago

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:01.514
that they were doing this.

00:08:01.514 --> 00:08:02.715
It wasn't disclosed

00:08:02.715 --> 00:08:03.449
because we didn't

00:08:03.449 --> 00:08:05.651
want the Chinese to know that we knew

00:08:05.651 --> 00:08:07.053
And that's something that's important.

00:08:07.053 --> 00:08:09.188
So bring the Congress in the Big Eight

00:08:09.422 --> 00:08:10.523
and sit down with them

00:08:10.523 --> 00:08:11.057
and let them know

00:08:11.057 --> 00:08:12.124
what's going on in terms

00:08:12.124 --> 00:08:13.059
of how we're going to approach it

00:08:13.059 --> 00:08:13.793
in the future.

00:08:13.793 --> 00:08:15.361
You'll have less people coming out

00:08:15.361 --> 00:08:16.362
and being critical.

00:08:16.362 --> 00:08:17.930
And Political Director Clapper.

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:18.130
U.S.

00:08:18.130 --> 00:08:19.398
intelligence officials indicated

00:08:19.398 --> 00:08:20.933
they don't believe that Chinese President

00:08:20.933 --> 00:08:22.935
Xi was aware of an order

00:08:22.935 --> 00:08:24.804
to send the spy balloon over the U.S.

00:08:24.804 --> 00:08:26.439
if the latest object

00:08:26.439 --> 00:08:28.674
turns out to be China again.

00:08:28.674 --> 00:08:29.509
I mean, do you.

00:08:29.509 --> 00:08:30.142
First of all, do you

00:08:30.142 --> 00:08:32.445
do you do you buy that that

00:08:32.445 --> 00:08:33.145
the president wouldn't

00:08:33.145 --> 00:08:33.846
have known the president?

00:08:33.846 --> 00:08:34.680
You wouldn't have known that

00:08:36.148 --> 00:08:37.683
No, I don't.

00:08:38.584 --> 00:08:40.386
The Chinese setup is

00:08:40.386 --> 00:08:42.955
there is a Politburo member

00:08:42.955 --> 00:08:45.324
who is the overseer, the senior overseer

00:08:45.558 --> 00:08:46.726
on behalf of the Politburo

00:08:46.726 --> 00:08:49.095
for the entirety of the intelligence

00:08:49.095 --> 00:08:51.364
and security apparatus of China,

00:08:51.364 --> 00:08:53.933
which is mammoth and is multi.

00:08:53.933 --> 00:08:54.166
They have

00:08:54.166 --> 00:08:56.102
many many organizations

00:08:56.102 --> 00:08:58.337
and agencies that are involved in this.

00:08:58.337 --> 00:09:00.106
So it's hard for me to believe that

00:09:00.106 --> 00:09:01.541
a Politburo member

00:09:01.541 --> 00:09:03.910
was directly associated with President Xi

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:05.945
would not have informed

00:09:05.945 --> 00:09:07.079
President Xi about it.

00:09:07.079 --> 00:09:09.148
So I don't buy that. Interesting.

00:09:09.181 --> 00:09:09.715
General Clapper,

00:09:09.715 --> 00:09:10.850
Secretary Cohen, I appreciate it.

00:09:10.850 --> 00:09:11.217
Thank you.

